  rdfs:comment "SKOS concept from EndorsementTimingScheme: PreBind, PostBind, MidTerm, Renewal. Required on all Endorsement-type ContractElements."@en ;
  rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://www.nebularis.org/neuro-semantic/insurance/contract> .

