clause. Distinct from retention amount: a proportional penalty for under-insurance,
not a deductible. Cardinality 0..1. Used for property policies with coinsurance
requirements."""@en ;
  rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://www.nebularis.org/neuro-semantic/insurance/contract> .

